    {
      "children": [
        {
          "content": "You always take what pleases you, no matter who it hurts, and you spread the influence of evil across all you touch. You gain the Selfish Shield champion's reaction and the ",
          "kind": "text",
          "marks": {
            "bold": false,
            "italic": false,
            "superscript": false
          }
        },
        {
          "display": "touch of corruption",
          "kind": "crossref",
          "targetId": "spell/touch-of-corruption"
        },
        {
          "content": " devotion spell. After the tenets of evil, add this tenet. ",
          "kind": "text",
          "marks": {
            "bold": false,
            "italic": false,
            "superscript": false
          }
        }
      ],
      "kind": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "items": [
        [
          {
            "content": "Subvert or corrupt everything in your path that is pure and good, and sow doubt among those upholding such ideals.",
